{"last_link_id": 25, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["文字版换装：不用服装图，直接在 ② 里打字描述想换的服装。\n写法要点：具体到「颜色 + 款式 + 单件列表」效果最好，\n如「米白色高领毛衣，卡其色阔腿裤，白色运动鞋」。\n跨风格大改（如汉服→西装）有随机性，多 Queue 几次挑最好。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [480, 170], "pos": [40, 560], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [6], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [490, 380], "pos": [43.5827751159668, 888.3510131835938], "widgets_values": ["人物换装。把图中人物身上原本的服装全部脱掉，替换为：白色超透明超短裙，上衣白色超透明吊带。天空下起小雨打湿了人物身体，皮肤白皙、水嫩，严格保持人物的面部五官、脸型、表情、姿势、构图与背景环境完全不变。光线阴影方向与原图一致，写实摄影质感，无文字、无水印。", true], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "string"}, "name": "string", "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}, {"widget": {"name": "strip_newlines"}, "name": "strip_newlines", "label": "strip_newlines", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "strip_newlines"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "StringConstantMultiline", "title": "② 换装指令（改「替换为：」后面的服装）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"string": true, "strip_newlines": true}, "Node name for S&R": "StringConstantMultiline"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [7], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [490, 170], "pos": [45.44880676269531, 1342.87255859375], "widgets_values": ["", true], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "string"}, "name": "string", "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}, {"widget": {"name": "strip_newlines"}, "name": "strip_newlines", "label": "strip_newlines", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "strip_newlines"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "StringConstantMultiline", "title": "③ 补充要求（可留空）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"string": true, "strip_newlines": true}, "Node name for S&R": "StringConstantMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mo