：颜色 + 款式 + 单件列表，越具体越稳。\n   例：「黑色羊毛长大衣，白色高领毛衣，深蓝色直筒牛仔裤」。\n3. 不想换发型：删掉②里「头饰与发饰配合新服装调整…」那句。\n4. 只换一件：改成「只把外套替换为…，其余衣物保持原图不变」。\n5. 跨风格大改（古装↔现代、正装↔休闲）有随机性：seed 已设 randomize，\n   多 Queue 几次挑最好；要 100% 稳定请用带服装图的那版工作流。\n6. 别改 cfg：实测 cfg>1（2.5/3.5）服从度没有提升反而姿势漂移。\n7. 换装后出现原服装残留（如袖口、裙摆）：在 ② 里点名\n   「XX必须完全消失」，或把残留物写进 ⑥ 负向提示词并改 cfg=2.5。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [700, 360], "pos": [27.835800170898438, 2009.8822021484375], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1, 4, 5], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [360, 420], "pos": [40, 93.54737091064453], "widgets_values": ["3b0fb4b7185c2f75cbcae8e0c4e984c131d0edb547d04a141cbc4c3253debe55.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "① 人物图（脸/姿势/背景保持这张）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 7}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [190.79768251561467, -52.990426984859255], "scale": 1.4122927695244514}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "① 输入：人物图（文字版无需服装图）", "bounding": [20, 20, 520, 730]}, {"color": "#a1309b", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "②③④ 换装指令（核心输入区）", "bounding": [24.515790939331055, 799.834228515625, 556.9639282226562, 1122.9405517578125]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "模型加载：Edit-2511 + Lightning", 